        "summary": "χT = 31.10 emu K mol−1 at 300 K, decreases to 12.56 emu K mol−1 at 22 K, then rises sharply to 26.81 emu K mol−1 at 8.7 K before dropping to 10.03 emu K mol−1 at 2 K, indicating ferromagnetic interactions. Magnetization is 5.98 μB at 2 K and 7 T. ZFC/FC divergence at about 9.2 K (50 Oe). Hysteresis at 2 K with coercivity 580 Oe and remnant magnetization 0.38 μB; loop closed at 9 K. Zero-field AC data show weakly frequency-dependent χ′/χ″ peaks between 8 and 10 K with φ = 0.02, assigned as spin-glass behaviour; an Arrhenius fit gave an unphysical τ0 = 2.43 × 10−57 s, excluding SMM behaviour.",
